{"id":"n17252-1-25","stage":1,"title":"오른쪽 · 右侧","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17252-1-25-1","ko":"기사님, 다음 골목에서 오른쪽으로 꺾어 주세요.","zh":"司机师傅，下个路口请向右转。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기사님,","meaning":"司机，驾驶员，操作员","explanation":"기사：司机，驾驶员，操作员；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"기사","audio":"/audio/1f896d183072b81262d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38269","senseId":"1","lemma":"기사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기사님","audio":"/audio/45d737438d78faef6674.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"下面，下一个","explanation":"다음：下面，下一个。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"1","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"골목에서","meaning":"巷子，胡同","explanation":"골목：巷子，胡同；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"골목","audio":"/audio/587e6d0cbedaf25ab43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18338","senseId":"1","lemma":"골목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"골목에서","audio":"/audio/8d111912ad5f54c3e8f5.mp3"}},{"text":"오른쪽으로","meaning":"右侧，右边","explanation":"오른쪽：右侧，右边；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"오른쪽","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17252","senseId":"1","lemma":"오른쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오른쪽으로","audio":"/audio/4fe8fc51ae3244e24c64.mp3"}},{"text":"꺾어","meaning":"调转，拐","explanation":"꺾다：调转，拐；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"꺾다","audio":"/audio/b0e06634cb051248ee98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32575","senseId":"6","lemma":"꺾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꺾어","audio":"/audio/6d647ed0e8e25240dd86.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1f896d183072b812","term":"기사","zh":"司机，驾驶员，操作员","audio":"/audio/1f896d183072b81262d9.mp3","entryId":"38269","definition":"职业驾驶汽车或操作机械设备等的人。","pronunciation":["기사"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"下面，下一个","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"某个次序的后一个。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"587e6d0cbedaf25a","term":"골목","zh":"巷子，胡同","audio":"/audio/587e6d0cbedaf25ab43f.mp3","entryId":"18338","definition":"两边有房屋的长而窄的街道。","pronunciation":["골ː목"]},{"id":"f594aa6a15b9381c","term":"오른쪽","zh":"右侧，右边","audio":"/audio/f594aa6a15b9381c0df7.mp3","entryId":"17252","definition":"人面向北边时和东边相同的一侧。","pronunciation":["오른쪽"]},{"id":"b0e06634cb051248","term":"꺾다","zh":"调转，拐","audio":"/audio/b0e06634cb051248ee98.mp3","entryId":"32575","definition":"调换方向。","pronunciation":["꺽따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0111288fc6993396f50d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17252-1-25-2","ko":"우회전이요? 네, 알겠습니다.","zh":"右转吗？好的，明白了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우회전이요?","meaning":"右转","explanation":"우회전：右转；이요：用于名词性简短回答，增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"우회전","audio":"/audio/33517c70db61c8ef4c75.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69014","senseId":"1","lemma":"우회전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우회전이요","audio":"/audio/af4111e0c14671c4d592.mp3"}},{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"알겠습니다.","mea